            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mame6695"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it! We grow jalapeños in our garden. Needed a recipe that called for a lot of peppers since I didn't want them to go bad. This was perfect! Wonderful taste &amp; we were able to freeze what we didn't use. Will definitely make over &amp; over again",
            "datePublished": "2015-09-13T14:55:51.297Z"
